1
00:03:15,662 --> 00:03:17,789
Priya , where 's my blade ?

2
00:03:18,064 --> 00:03:20,589
Must be near the sink . - Okay .

3
00:03:21,267 --> 00:03:23,326
I am putting the clothes in the machine .

4
00:03:23,403 --> 00:03:25,166
Divya , wash the white ones separately .

5
00:03:25,238 --> 00:03:27,229
Or else they will get coloured as well . - Okay .

6
00:03:28,174 --> 00:03:30,802
Put my clothes in too , Aunt . - Fine , put them in .

7
00:03:34,380 --> 00:03:36,075
Deepa . I 'm getting late . Quickly get me tea .

8
00:03:36,149 --> 00:03:37,673
Right away . Just a second .

9
00:03:38,585 --> 00:03:42,681
Priya , please give Manoj tea . I have to get the children ready . - Okay .

10
00:03:44,624 --> 00:03:47,354
Riya , quickly drink your milk . You 'll miss your school bus .

11
00:03:52,799 --> 00:03:55,768
Divya . Divya . - Yes .

12
00:03:56,035 --> 00:03:58,333
Have this kept in the prayer room . - Okay .

13
00:04:04,377 --> 00:04:06,072
The milk has curdled again . It 's just too much .

14
00:04:09,048 --> 00:04:10,106
Good morning , brother . - Morning .

15
00:04:10,183 --> 00:04:11,445
How was your first night in the new house ? .

16
00:04:12,151 --> 00:04:15,279
Like always . - Really . You seem to be experienced about first nights .

17
00:04:15,655 --> 00:04:17,054
Of course . I have two children .

18
00:04:17,357 --> 00:04:18,449
Wait to go , brother .

19
00:04:18,491 --> 00:04:20,459
Fetch it quickly . I am getting late .

20
00:04:26,733 --> 00:04:29,793
Mannu , please check the cable connection before leaving for office .

21
00:04:30,069 --> 00:04:31,661
We couldn 't watch our serial yesterday .

22
00:04:31,804 --> 00:04:34,329
Gas , electricity , water .. they aren 't worried about these things .

23
00:04:34,407 --> 00:04:36,568
But they create a stir for no cable connection .

24
00:04:37,110 --> 00:04:39,237
Mom , the serial starts at 1 o 'clock .

25
00:04:39,312 --> 00:04:40,370
Why are you whining already ? .

26
00:04:40,446 --> 00:04:42,141
What ? . I couldn 't hear anything .

27
00:04:42,448 --> 00:04:45,542
Mummy , your son is mocking our serial .

28
00:04:46,252 --> 00:04:50,188
Okay . Brother , hold on . - What happened ? .

29
00:04:50,223 --> 00:04:51,485
What 's wrong with the tea ? . It tastes different .

30
00:04:51,624 --> 00:04:53,751
I 've used milk powder . The milk curdled again .

31
00:04:54,427 --> 00:04:57,157
Try to adjust today . - The milk curdled again .

32
00:04:57,230 --> 00:04:59,425
Yes . - It 's not a good omen .

33
00:05:00,099 --> 00:05:01,464
What 's wrong ? . - The milk curdled yesterday .

34
00:05:01,534 --> 00:05:03,627
And today as well . That 's not a good omen at all .

35
00:05:03,770 --> 00:05:05,169
Mom . Mom , sit . Take a seat . - Sit .

36
00:05:05,238 --> 00:05:06,296
Sit , let me explain it to you . - But you know , it 's ..

37
00:05:06,372 --> 00:05:07,430
Sit , let me explain it to you .

38
00:05:07,573 --> 00:05:12,237
Look , brother and I used all of our savings to buy this flat . - Yes .

39
00:05:12,312 --> 00:05:13,370
Now , this flat won 't be ours ..

40
00:05:13,446 --> 00:05:15,073
.. until we don 't repay the loan in the next 20 years .

41
00:05:15,214 --> 00:05:16,647
So , forget all the bad omens .

42
00:05:16,716 --> 00:05:18,047
Because we are going to live in this house happily ..

43
00:05:18,117 --> 00:05:19,448
.. for the next 20 years . - Yes .

44
00:05:19,585 --> 00:05:20,643
Brother , please tell her . - Of course .

45
00:05:20,687 --> 00:05:24,054
Uncle . - Young man , that 's not a toy .

46
00:05:24,157 --> 00:05:26,352
Your uncle had to pay a lot of money to buy this .

47
00:05:26,526 --> 00:05:29,393
Go to school . Come on , go . - Come on . Get ready quickly .

48
00:05:29,462 --> 00:05:30,520
We are getting late . - Have your breakfast .

49
00:05:30,596 --> 00:05:32,564
The children these days go straight for the mobile phones .

50
00:05:32,632 --> 00:05:35,624
You will get late for school . - Mom , last cartoon .

51
00:05:35,702 --> 00:05:38,227
Don 't watch so much T.V. , or else you will have to wear spectacles .

52
00:05:38,471 --> 00:05:41,463
Grandma , aunt and you watch T.V. the entire day .

53
00:05:41,641 --> 00:05:43,302
You never had to wear spectacles .

54
00:05:43,376 --> 00:05:46,072
Quiet . You have started back-answering ..

55
00:05:46,145 --> 00:05:47,373
.. since you started going to school .

56
00:05:47,447 --> 00:05:48,505
Come on , eat .

57
00:05:49,749 --> 00:05:51,148
Come on . Let 's go to school .

58
00:05:51,284 --> 00:05:54,219
Brother , talk to him . - I tried to , but he never listens .

59
00:05:54,253 --> 00:05:55,345
Mother , we are getting late .

60
00:05:55,421 --> 00:05:57,013
I 'll take them to their pickup spot . - Okay . - Come on , let 's leave .

61
00:05:57,123 --> 00:06:00,058
Bye . Bye . - Bye . All the best . - Bye , mom .

62
00:06:00,426 --> 00:06:04,089
Brother , don 't forget me . - I thought you forgot about it .

63
00:06:05,031 --> 00:06:06,089
Anyway . - What ? .

64
00:06:06,165 --> 00:06:07,393
Be back before 6 o 'clock in the evening .

65
00:06:07,567 --> 00:06:11,401
Yeah , I will be back . Bye , Mom . Bye , everyone . - Bye .

66
00:06:11,471 --> 00:06:13,496
Have your breakfast . - I 'll have it at college .

67
00:06:13,573 --> 00:06:15,541
This girl never eats anything .

68
00:06:16,743 --> 00:06:18,142
Mannu . - What is it ? .

69
00:06:18,211 --> 00:06:20,076
You still haven 't put up the pictures in the prayer room .

70
00:06:20,213 --> 00:06:21,771
Sorry , brother . I didn 't get the time yesterday .

71
00:06:22,048 --> 00:06:23,106
I will certainly get it done today .

72
00:06:23,182 --> 00:06:24,240
Promise . - Promise .

73
00:06:24,317 --> 00:06:25,375
Don 't forget to do it by evening .

74
00:06:25,451 --> 00:06:28,477
Okay , Mom . I 'm leaving . - Okay , son . Bye .

75
00:06:28,588 --> 00:06:29,646
I am getting late as well . I 'm leaving .

76
00:06:29,689 --> 00:06:30,747
We 'll meet in the evening . - Bye .

77
00:06:31,057 --> 00:06:33,184
Fine , Mom . - Bye .

78
00:06:33,259 --> 00:06:34,658
See you , mother . - Bye , dear .

79
00:06:35,161 --> 00:06:37,652
Mom , I am leaving . - Fine .

80
00:06:38,231 --> 00:06:40,791
Mom , I am leaving - Go .

81
00:06:41,567 --> 00:06:44,661
Mom , I am leaving . - Why are you blowing at my ears ? .

82
00:06:44,737 --> 00:06:46,068
If you want to say goodbye to Priya , then go inside .

83
00:06:46,205 --> 00:06:52,235
She 's taking a bath . - No Mom , I meant you . Fool .

84
00:07:50,102 --> 00:07:51,160
Strange .

85
00:07:51,671 --> 00:07:54,037
Sir . Sir , your dog ! - No .

86
00:07:54,207 --> 00:07:56,300
Come back . Harry , no . Down , boy .

87
00:07:56,375 --> 00:07:58,536
Down , boy . - Sir , please . Keep your dog away .

88
00:07:58,744 --> 00:08:01,440
Who is it ? . - Sir , my name is Manohar .

89
00:08:01,514 --> 00:08:04,039
And I recently shifted to flat number 1 3B .

90
00:08:04,217 --> 00:08:07,050
Oh , hello . My name is Kaamdar .

91
00:08:07,753 --> 00:08:11,655
The watchman was just talking about your family . - Really !

92
00:08:11,724 --> 00:08:14,022
For the past two weeks your carpenters ..

93
00:08:14,093 --> 00:08:17,756
.. were creating quite a racket . - I am really sorry .

94
00:08:18,030 --> 00:08:21,261
I tried to tell them . But you know how these people are .

95
00:08:21,334 --> 00:08:24,132
No problem . Actually , it 's a new building .

96
00:08:24,270 --> 00:08:26,761
No one has the right to complain .

97
00:08:27,273 --> 00:08:32,643
But yes , I do . The Lord took away my sight .

98
00:08:33,346 --> 00:08:34,506
But I still have ears to listen .

99
00:08:36,148 --> 00:08:39,049
But if you keep making such noise ..

100
00:08:39,118 --> 00:08:41,484
.. I will have to use earplugs .

101
00:08:42,555 --> 00:08:43,579
I am so sorry .

102
00:08:43,656 --> 00:08:45,248
By the way , I am getting late . Can I leave ? .

103
00:08:46,259 --> 00:08:48,124
Sir , next Friday I have a holiday .

104
00:08:48,261 --> 00:08:50,786
If you wish , you can have lunch with me and my family .

105
00:08:51,063 --> 00:08:52,121
What do you say ? .

106
00:08:52,198 --> 00:08:53,665
Sure . Why not ? . I will surely come .

107
00:08:53,733 --> 00:08:55,496
See you , bye . Bye , Harry . - Bye .

108
00:08:59,739 --> 00:09:01,468
Mr. Manohar . - Yes .

109
00:09:02,174 --> 00:09:04,608
Will you walk down 1 3 floors ? .

110
00:09:05,011 --> 00:09:06,569
There 's a lift . Let 's use that .

111
00:09:06,712 --> 00:09:08,236
Actually , the lift is not working .

112
00:09:08,314 --> 00:09:10,612
I thought I 'd tell the watchman on my way out .

113
00:09:10,750 --> 00:09:12,047
Oh , fine .

114
00:09:18,658 --> 00:09:19,716
Come , Harry .

115
00:10:53,653 --> 00:10:54,677
Stupid lift .

116
00:11:05,531 --> 00:11:06,589
Watchman !

117
00:11:19,311 --> 00:11:24,374
You called , sir . - Slowly , man . Not so hard .

118
00:11:25,251 --> 00:11:27,412
Do you know my flat , 1 3B ? . - Yes , sir .

119
00:11:27,486 --> 00:11:29,078
Just go there between 1 pm to 1 : 30pm ..

120
00:11:29,121 --> 00:11:32,090
.. put up a few pictures in the prayer room ..

121
00:11:32,124 --> 00:11:33,591
Fine , sir . - Here , keep this .

122
00:11:34,593 --> 00:11:37,460
Listen , don 't go there between 1 pm to 1 : 30pm . Go after that .

123
00:11:37,530 --> 00:11:40,158
They will be watching TV , and will kill you . - Fine , sir .

124
00:11:40,232 --> 00:11:42,257
Okay , I am leaving . - Okay .

125
00:11:46,338 --> 00:11:47,396
Watchman . - Sir .

126
00:11:48,207 --> 00:11:50,573
The lift of our building is not working properly . - Yes , sir .

127
00:11:50,643 --> 00:11:53,203
Call the service company and ask them to repair it . - Fine , sir .

128
00:11:53,279 --> 00:11:54,337
I will get it done . Okay .

129
00:11:54,413 --> 00:11:57,473
I am leaving . - Okay . - Okay , sir .

130
00:12:15,367 --> 00:12:16,561
Good morning , sir . - Morning .

131
00:12:19,071 --> 00:12:20,197
He will get you out .

132
00:12:20,272 --> 00:12:21,330
Morning , sir . - Morning .

133
00:12:21,407 --> 00:12:22,465
Hey , what 's up ? . - Morning , sir .

134
00:12:22,541 --> 00:12:24,236
Has the concrete arrived ? . - Forget the concrete .

135
00:12:24,443 --> 00:12:25,808
Tell me about your new house .

136
00:12:26,078 --> 00:12:28,069
The house is simply amazing . - Is it ? .

137
00:12:28,147 --> 00:12:30,081
When I open the window of my flat on the 1 3th floor ..

138
00:12:30,149 --> 00:12:31,616
.. it feels like Manhattan . - Very good .

139
00:12:31,684 --> 00:12:34,414
And the cross ventilation is simply outstanding . - Really .

140
00:12:34,487 --> 00:12:36,717
Just a minute . - Hello .

141
00:12:38,224 --> 00:12:41,352
I don 't need any loan . I am already in debt .

142
00:12:41,494 --> 00:12:44,088
Pestering people . I think the ad agency gets our number ..

143
00:12:44,163 --> 00:12:45,221
.. before we do .

144
00:12:45,397 --> 00:12:49,356
New phone , new house . You are on a roll . - Listen .

145
00:12:51,470 --> 00:12:54,303
I got it on discount . It 's a very cheap phone . - Liar .

146
00:12:58,377 --> 00:12:59,435
What 's wrong ? .

147
00:12:59,779 --> 00:13:03,271
Get it changed from wherever you bought it .

148
00:13:04,150 --> 00:13:05,310
There 's a problem with the lens .

149
00:13:10,389 --> 00:13:11,447
It was fine this morning .

150
00:13:13,659 --> 00:13:18,153
Smile . You are looking handsome .

151
00:13:18,230 --> 00:13:20,357
Alright . - I think Gulabi will be floored . - Of course .

152
00:13:26,105 --> 00:13:29,370
There 's no problem with the phone .

153
00:13:29,441 --> 00:13:31,136
My 7-year-old nephew took that picture .

154
00:13:31,210 --> 00:13:32,541
He must have shaken the mobile . Get that .

155
00:13:32,678 --> 00:13:34,339
Are all the workers present ? . - Yes , sir .

156
00:13:37,683 --> 00:13:41,585
Tell me , Laxmi . If he 's not my child , then whose is it ? .

157
00:13:42,221 --> 00:13:45,281
What can I say ? . - Laxmi , say something .

158
00:13:46,392 --> 00:13:49,225
They always end it so abruptly .

159
00:13:49,428 --> 00:13:51,089
Laxmi didn 't get a chance to tell him the truth ..

160
00:13:51,163 --> 00:13:52,630
.. and they ended the programme .

161
00:13:53,465 --> 00:13:56,696
Mummy , you watch the programme so seriously .

162
00:13:57,036 --> 00:13:58,162
You should start writing one .

163
00:13:58,304 --> 00:14:01,398
Our TV programme will be a hit , right ? . - Quiet .

164
00:14:01,473 --> 00:14:04,067
You are just .. Mummy , sister-in-law is right .

165
00:14:04,143 --> 00:14:06,236
Priya , ' Shubh Vivaah ' will start now .

166
00:14:06,378 --> 00:14:08,278
Bring the remote quickly . Change the channel .

167
00:14:09,615 --> 00:14:10,673
Hurry up .

168
00:14:11,650 --> 00:14:14,448
Mummy , tell me what happened last week .

169
00:14:14,653 --> 00:14:18,749
Last week .. The door bell rung and Mandira opened the door .

170
00:14:19,058 --> 00:14:22,494
The music was so scary ..

171
00:14:22,561 --> 00:14:24,324
Mummy , there 's no one .

172
00:14:24,463 --> 00:14:26,055
Must be the gas cylinder guy .

173
00:14:27,166 --> 00:14:28,531
Change it . - Press it .

174
00:14:29,401 --> 00:14:33,132
Come on . - What 's wrong ? . - I cannot change it .

175
00:14:33,606 --> 00:14:34,664
Just a minute . I 'll try it .

176
00:14:34,740 --> 00:14:35,798
You will make me miss ' Shubh Vivaah ' .

177
00:14:36,075 --> 00:14:38,270
The battery must be dead . Change it from the panel .

178
00:14:39,111 --> 00:14:41,238
Hurry up . It 's time for the serial to start .

179
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:49,517
Mummy , I cannot change the channel .

180
00:14:49,788 --> 00:14:51,688
Is something wrong with the T.V. ? . - I don 't know .

181
00:14:55,127 --> 00:14:57,425
What 's this ? . - Seems to be a new serial .

182
00:14:58,097 --> 00:15:00,531
New serial . New house and new serial .

183
00:15:00,599 --> 00:15:03,295
" Fine ! Everything is fine ! "

184
00:15:03,369 --> 00:15:05,166
And anyway , ' Shubh Vivaah ' had become very boring .

185
00:15:05,237 --> 00:15:10,106
" Everything is fine . "

186
00:15:10,242 --> 00:15:15,236
" Everything is fine . "

187
00:15:17,049 --> 00:15:24,148
" Everything is fine . "

188
00:15:36,268 --> 00:15:42,070
Look , Mother . After all the tribulations and difficulties ..

189
00:15:42,141 --> 00:15:45,201
.. our house looks so wonderful .

190
00:15:47,479 --> 00:15:50,073
It really is beautiful . But son ..

191
00:15:50,149 --> 00:15:54,347
.. did we need to pay such a big price for it ? .

192
00:15:54,520 --> 00:15:58,320
Mother , your happiness is priceless to us .

193
00:15:59,024 --> 00:16:00,423
Brother and I have taken a loan .

194
00:16:00,592 --> 00:16:03,186
And Mother , we will repay this loan soon enough .

195
00:17:22,107 --> 00:17:23,165
Watchman .

196
00:17:30,783 --> 00:17:32,717
Oh God , what a punishment .

197
00:17:41,293 --> 00:17:45,161
What 's wrong ? . Why are you gasping ? .

198
00:17:45,330 --> 00:17:47,594
You don 't know . I had to climb up 1 3 floors .

199
00:17:48,267 --> 00:17:50,292
I told the watchman that the lift is not working .

200
00:17:50,369 --> 00:17:51,427
But he didn 't do anything about it .

201
00:17:57,376 --> 00:17:58,536
Give it to me . - Thanks .

202
00:17:59,711 --> 00:18:01,576
Oh God . - What ? .

203
00:18:01,647 --> 00:18:03,171
You still haven 't put up the pictures . - What can I do ? .

204
00:18:03,248 --> 00:18:06,445
I gave Rs.50 to that watchman for putting them up . Didn 't he come ? .

205
00:18:07,052 --> 00:18:10,419
He did , and also tried . But he couldn 't bore the nails in .

206
00:18:10,522 --> 00:18:14,424
I think there 's a beam here . - What ? .

207
00:18:14,560 --> 00:18:16,323
As an engineer 's wife , you know everything .

208
00:18:16,462 --> 00:18:18,020
There 's a beam through the entire room . - Could be .

209
00:18:18,430 --> 00:18:21,331
Okay , do one thing . Get me a hammer . I will do it .

210
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:23,027
Before brother arrives and hammers me .

211
00:18:23,102 --> 00:18:24,160
Fine .

212
00:18:38,650 --> 00:18:43,246
Only after her family ran into trouble , did she realise it .

213
00:18:43,455 --> 00:18:47,414
Now she 'll realise there 's a delay , but not denial .

214
00:18:47,793 --> 00:18:50,091
She 'll know it now .

215
00:18:51,063 --> 00:18:57,434
Who ? . - I always said so , but you never believed me .

216
00:18:57,503 --> 00:19:01,166
Did you see that now ? . - Listen . What is mom gossiping about ? .

217
00:19:01,306 --> 00:19:03,274
About the daily soap operas .

218
00:19:04,409 --> 00:19:07,071
Oh God . - She couldn 't see today 's episode . She missed it .

219
00:19:07,146 --> 00:19:08,738
So , she 's asking aunt Kamla about it .

220
00:19:09,014 --> 00:19:10,675
You and your serials .

221
00:19:10,749 --> 00:19:12,011
You 've been watching the same TV programme for many years .

222
00:19:12,084 --> 00:19:13,244
The same story . Doesn 't it make any difference to you ? .

223
00:19:13,318 --> 00:19:14,751
Darling , why don 't you watch some episodes ? .

224
00:19:15,020 --> 00:19:16,044
And then we can discuss them .

225
00:19:16,155 --> 00:19:17,213
Forget it . - Don 't mock me .

226
00:19:18,257 --> 00:19:21,693
Faces change .

227
00:19:25,364 --> 00:19:30,631
She joins in again .

228
00:19:31,270 --> 00:19:34,467
Look at her role ..

229
00:19:35,107 --> 00:19:39,441
Just a minute . Mannu , why are you creating a racket ? .

230
00:19:39,578 --> 00:19:41,512
Do it slowly . I am talking on the phone .

231
00:19:43,649 --> 00:19:44,707
Yes , Kamla .

232
00:19:46,685 --> 00:19:47,777
Mannu , didn 't you hear ? .

233
00:19:58,430 --> 00:20:00,796
Oh God . Damn it !

234
00:20:01,333 --> 00:20:03,096
What happened ? . You are just ..

235
00:20:03,302 --> 00:20:05,600
What do you think ? . I am hurt . Get some ice . - I 'll get it right away .

236
00:20:06,138 --> 00:20:09,107
Mummy , see what happened . - What happened ? . What happened ? .

237
00:20:09,374 --> 00:20:11,569
I got hurt . - What was the need ? .

238
00:20:11,710 --> 00:20:14,679
You came home late from work . You should be resting ..

239
00:20:14,746 --> 00:20:18,182
And you are doing this . - What a wonderful mother . Don 't be silly .

240
00:20:18,650 --> 00:20:22,381
No , nothing . - Mannu , you .. Here , keep this .

241
00:20:23,722 --> 00:20:25,519
God . - It must be really painful .

242
00:20:41,340 --> 00:20:44,400
It 's the 21st Manohar . Remember to pay the flat maintenance fee .

243
00:20:47,679 --> 00:20:50,239
That 's all . What 's this ? . Lower your feet .

244
00:20:50,849 --> 00:20:53,249
Come on , your mummy is waiting with the milk . - Papa , Papa .

